the floor, your souls drain aw","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:47:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685327","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4937640-1843481262701148","game_id":"steam-4937640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.5.2 — Heavier hits, smarter packs, defeat screen.","summary":"The Offering Hour Demo v0.5.2 is now live.This update is about how combat feels, and about making a lost run tell you something.Combat feel- Avatar heavy skills now land with a brief hit-stop, and an Avatar's descent hits harder when it arrives.- Heroes and monsters now react to being hit: light blows nudge them, heavy blows knock them back.- Monster packs now surround their target instead of piling into one jittering clump.- Avatar roars no longer get cut off in the middle of a big fight.How sk","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T09:16:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4937640-1840944183780255","game_id":"steam-4937640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.5.0 — Three-Way Arena Brawls: Reinforcement Waves & a Third Faction","summary":"Sacrificers, the arena is no longer a 1v1.- Heroes don't fight alone anymore: human, dwarf, elf and Silverguard reinforcements pour in through portals, wave after wave- A second hero steps through the main gate to join the hunt when the fight turns against them- Slay a hero and the Silverguard retaliates, led by a Silverguard Captain; push the last hero to the brink and their entire army marches in- A third faction crashes the party: bandit gangs and viking raiders barge into the arena at random","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T16:52:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183780255","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4937640-1840310314344218","game_id":"steam-4937640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.4.4: New Avatar Picker & Better Openings","summary":"The demo has been updated to v0.4.4Avatars▸ Avatar picker: redesigned as a rolling drum — qualified avatars scroll in, with their names revealed in burning letters.▸ Ready notification: when an avatar becomes available, a prompt appears mid-screen — click it to jump straight to the avatar page.Better openings▸ Starting hand: now a fixed trio — a tank, a runner and a ranged monster. No more dead opening draws.Polish▸ Main menu: all UI now fades out properly during the door transition.▸ Fixed: sac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T08:58:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344218","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4937640-1840310314339572","game_id":"steam-4937640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.4.3: Mutant Monsters, Burning Dragonkin","summary":"The demo has been updated to v0.4.3.Mutant monsters▸ Mutants: T1-T3 monsters now have a chance to spawn as mutant variants — Giant (bigger, tougher) or Frenzied (faster, hits harder, burns red), each with unique art.Combat readability▸ T3 monsters: every 4th attack is a heavy strike.▸ Dragonkin: the fire trail is gone — with 4 or more Dragonkin on the field, their bodies ignite and burn nearby heroes.Avatars▸ Unlock thresholds: lowered across the board — you transform earlier in a run.Fixes and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T16:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339572","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4937640-1839676055891956","game_id":"steam-4937640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.4.1 — Now in Russian, Spanish & Japanese","summary":"This update brings the game to more players — and makes the battlefield easier to read.▸ Three new languages: Русский, Español, 日本語 — full translation of UI, monsters, merchant dialogue and the bestiary▸ Hero ultimates now telegraph with a red warning ring that fills up as they charge — see it, dodge it▸ Map transitions no longer stutter; the teleport ritual plays out in full▸ Smaller download sizeFeedback is welcome in the discussions — I read every post.The full version is in development. Wish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T03:40:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055891956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4937640-1839676055883406","game_id":"steam-4937640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.4.0: Speed Overhaul + 30 Combat Fixes","summary":"Until now, every monster you summoned moved at roughly the same speed, and none of them could ever catch a hero.This update rebuilds the entire speed system. Whether you can run a hero down is now a deckbuilding decision.⚡ Speed System Overhaul▸ All 84 monsters re-tiered into nine speed tiers, from super-heavy tanks to suicide bombers▸ Want to finish off a fleeing hero? Leave room in your deck for fast monsters▸ The spread between the slowest and fastest hero widened from 1.19x to 1.42x▸ Dire Wo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https:/